    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE AUGUST 1 THROUGH SEPTEMBER 6, 1965\nWESTERN\nAIRLINES\nFLY TO\n*BG\nNORTHWEST\nON\nBETWEEN\nCALIFORNIA \u0026 SEATTLE /TACOMA OR PORTLAND\nONLY WESTERN HAS\n4-ENGINE 720-B FANJETS ON EVERY FLIGHT\nCOACH AND DELUXE SERVICE ON EVERY FLIGHT",
      "Nậu\nFamily\nPlan\nSavings\nOn WESTERN\nFrom noon Monday through noon Friday, the head of the\nfamily buys one full-fare, one way Coach ticket for a domestic\nflight: wife flies for 2/3 the regular fare -children 2 through\n21 years of age pay 1/3 fare! A child under 2 travels free.\nBig discounts in the Deluxe section are also available.\nA FAMILY PLAN FOR WEEKENDS, TOO\nSpecial discounts on both Deluxe and Coach flights, midnight\nFriday through noon Sunday... ask for complete details.\n5 * 12\n46349424547\n41 30 34\n42 42\nVESTERN AIRLINES\n.жн....\n1999.015.203"
    ],
